#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "A Redis object-cache activation is already pending verification."
msgstr "Attivazzjoni tal-cache tal-oġġetti Redis diġà qed tistenna verifika."

#: includes/class-yperf-product-progress.php
msgid "A YPerf optimization is enabled and proven"
msgstr "Ottimizzazzjoni ta' YPerf hija attivata u vverifikata"

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "A clean baseline was captured before migration."
msgstr "Inġabret linja bażi nadifa qabel il-migrazzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before AI-assisted "
"configuration can be applied."
msgstr ""
"Qabel ma tiġi applikata konfigurazzjoni assistita mill-AI, hija meħtieġa "
"aċċettazzjoni nadifa tal-ambjent ta' eżekuzzjoni għall-verżjoni attwali."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before the R3 object-"
"cache activation can be approved."
msgstr ""
"Qabel ma tiġi approvata l-attivazzjoni tal-cache tal-oġġetti R3, hija "
"meħtieġa aċċettazzjoni nadifa tal-ambjent ta' eżekuzzjoni għall-verżjoni "
"attwali."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A compact guide for the provider workflow. No Cloudflare expertise is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Gwida fil-qosor għall-proċess tal-fornitur. M'hemmx bżonn għarfien "
"speċjalizzat dwar Cloudflare."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists but WordPress did not confirm an active external object "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"Jeżisti drop-in, iżda WordPress ma kkonfermax cache esterna tal-oġġetti "
"attiva."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A drop-in exists. Ownership must be known before YPerf adopts page caching."
msgstr ""
"Jeżisti drop-in. Is-sjieda trid tkun magħrufa qabel YPerf jadotta l-cache "
"tal-paġni."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A feature depending on this extension may be limited."
msgstr "Karatteristika li tiddependi fuq din l-estensjoni tista' tkun limitata."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed and automatic rollback could not be confirmed."
" Stop and review the cache artifact before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Kampjun HIT mill-cache sħun falla u ma setax jiġi kkonfermat it-treġġigħ "
"lura awtomatiku. Waqqaf u eżamina l-komponent tal-cache qabel tkompli."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed during stability measurement. The new "
"activation was rolled back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kampjun HIT mill-cache sħun falla waqt il-kejl tal-istabbiltà. "
"L-attivazzjoni l-ġdida treġġgħet lura awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed while re-proving an existing executor. The "
"pre-existing cache was not removed automatically and requires review."
msgstr ""
"Kampjun HIT mill-cache sħun falla waqt verifika mill-ġdid ta' eżekutur "
"eżistenti. Il-cache preċedenti ma tneħħietx awtomatikament u teħtieġ "
"reviżjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A local under-the-hood report that combines WordPress, runtime, cache, "
"application and acceptance evidence. Nothing is sent remotely."
msgstr ""
"Rapport lokali dettaljat li jgħaqqad evidenza ta' WordPress, tal-ambjent ta'"
" eżekuzzjoni, tal-cache, tal-applikazzjoni u tal-aċċettazzjoni. Xejn ma "
"jintbagħat mill-bogħod."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A material performance regression repeated on the confirmation pass. YPerf "
"rolled the profile back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Rigressjoni sinifikanti fil-prestazzjoni reġgħet seħħet fil-verifika ta' "
"konferma. YPerf reġġa' lura l-profil awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A memory engine may be available, but WordPress has not confirmed an adopted"
" persistent object-cache execution layer."
msgstr ""
"Jista' jkun disponibbli magna tal-memorja, iżda WordPress għadu ma "
"kkonfermax saff adottat ta' cache persistenti tal-oġġetti."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record already exists. YPerf will not activate "
"a second page-cache executor until that authority is reviewed or released."
msgstr ""
"Diġà jeżisti rekord ta' adozzjoni tal-cache tal-paġni nattiva. YPerf mhux se"
" jattiva eżekutur ieħor tal-cache tal-paġni sakemm dik l-awtorità tiġi "
"riveduta jew rilaxxata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A new activation rolls back automatically if cache proof or Runtime "
"Acceptance fails."
msgstr ""
"Attivazzjoni ġdida titreġġa' lura awtomatikament jekk il-prova tal-cache jew"
" l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni tfalli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A no-change planning surface built from WordPress evidence plus the optional"
" host snapshot. Explicit execution lives in the dedicated adoption/operation"
" cards and remains gated by ownership, proof and rollback contracts."
msgstr ""
"Żona ta' ppjanar mingħajr bidliet, ibbażata fuq evidenza ta' WordPress u "
"snapshot fakultattiv tal-host. L-eżekuzzjoni espliċita ssir fil-kards "
"apposta għall-adozzjoni u t-tħaddim u tibqa' soġġetta għall-kundizzjonijiet "
"ta' sjieda, prova u treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"A previous adoption record exists, but current proof no longer matches or is"
" stale. Re-prove execution before treating the adoption as current."
msgstr ""
"Jeżisti rekord ta' adozzjoni preċedenti, iżda l-prova attwali ma taqbilx "
"aktar jew skadiet. Ivverifika mill-ġdid l-eżekuzzjoni qabel tqis l-adozzjoni"
" bħala attwali."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind manual removal. "
"The transactional handover deactivates the provider first, reconciles YPerf "
"ownership, proves execution, and automatically restores the previous "
"provider if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php li jappartjeni lill-fornitur xorta jista' "
"jimblokka t-tneħħija manwali mingħajr verifika. It-trasferiment "
"tranżazzjonali l-ewwel jiddiżattiva lill-fornitur, jirrikonċilja s-sjieda "
"ta' YPerf, jivverifika l-eżekuzzjoni u jerġa' jattiva awtomatikament lill-"
"fornitur preċedenti jekk il-prova tfalli."

msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind removal. YPerf "
"prepares a reversible handoff, but you control W3 Total Cache activation on "
"the normal Plugins screen. After your confirmation, YPerf reconciles "
"ownership and proves the replacement."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php li jappartjeni lill-fornitur xorta jista' "
"jimblokka t-tneħħija mingħajr verifika. YPerf iħejji trasferiment "
"riversibbli, iżda inti tikkontrolla l-attivazzjoni ta' W3 Total Cache fl-"
"iskrin normali tal-Plugins. Wara l-konferma tiegħek, YPerf jirrikonċilja "
"s-sjieda u jivverifika s-sostituzzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A read-only site health check. It verifies public routes, cache safety and "
"origin behavior without changing settings."
msgstr ""
"Verifika tas-saħħa tas-sit għall-qari biss. Tivverifika r-rotot pubbliċi, "
"is-sigurtà tal-cache u l-imġiba tas-server tas-sors mingħajr ma tbiddel is-"
"settings."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"A score is diagnostic evidence, not a cache engine. YPerf should explain why"
" a page is slow and which layer owns the cost."
msgstr ""
"Punteġġ huwa evidenza dijanjostika, mhux magna tal-cache. YPerf għandu "
"jispjega għaliex paġna hija bil-mod u liema saff huwa responsabbli għall-"
"ispiża."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "A second pass prevents one noisy sample from triggering rollback by itself."
msgstr ""
"It-tieni pass jipprevjeni li kampjun wieħed b'ħafna storbju jikkawża "
"treġġigħ lura waħdu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A technical map of YPerf and detected acceleration layers. Use Optimize or "
"Settings for normal on/off control."
msgstr ""
"Mappa teknika ta' YPerf u tas-saffi ta' aċċellerazzjoni misjuba. Uża "
"Ottimizza jew Settings għall-kontroll normali mixgħul/mitfi."

