"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php ta' W3 Total Cache ma setax jinqara biex tinġabar"
" kopja għat-treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be removed with verified "
"read-back."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php ta' W3 Total Cache ma setax jitneħħa b'qari mill-"
"ġdid ivverifikat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache plugin is inactive, but advanced-cache.php still requires"
" the protected final cleanup shown in Step 5 above."
msgstr ""
"Il-plugin W3 Total Cache mhuwiex attiv, iżda advanced-cache.php għadu "
"jeħtieġ it-tindif finali protett muri fil-Pass 5 hawn fuq."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The W3TC Cloudflare extension is retired. Cloudflare DNS/proxy and saved "
"Cloudflare settings were not changed."
msgstr ""
"L-estensjoni Cloudflare ta' W3TC ġiet irtirata. Id-DNS/proxy Cloudflare u "
"s-settings Cloudflare ssejvjati ma nbidlux."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The WordPress content directory is unavailable for legacy drop-in rollback."
msgstr ""
"Id-direttorju tal-kontenut WordPress mhuwiex disponibbli għat-treġġigħ lura "
"tad-drop-in preċedenti."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The WordPress content directory is unavailable for verified cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Id-direttorju tal-kontenut WordPress mhuwiex disponibbli għat-tindif "
"ivverifikat."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid "The YPerf Page Cache is no longer active, so stability sampling stopped."
msgstr ""
"Il-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf m'għadhiex attiva, għalhekk ittieħed waqfien "
"mill-ġbir tal-kampjuni tal-istabbiltà."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf advanced-cache.php hash changed after activation. Automatic "
"removal is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Il-hash ta' advanced-cache.php ta' YPerf inbidel wara l-attivazzjoni. It-"
"tneħħija awtomatika hija mblukkata għal reviżjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf advanced-cache.php template is unavailable."
msgstr "It-template advanced-cache.php ta' YPerf mhuwiex disponibbli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The YPerf control operation failed."
msgstr "L-operazzjoni tal-kontroll ta' YPerf falliet."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf object-cache drop-in changed after activation. Automatic removal "
"is blocked until ownership is reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti ta' YPerf inbidel wara l-attivazzjoni. It-"
"tneħħija awtomatika hija mblukkata sakemm is-sjieda tiġi riveduta."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf object-cache drop-in template is unavailable."
msgstr "It-template tad-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti ta' YPerf mhuwiex disponibbli."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf page-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr ""
"It-template tad-drop-in tal-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf ma setax jiġi ġġenerat"
" b'mod sigur."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf-owned portable Page Cache already owns page-cache execution. "
"Native Nginx adoption stays locked so the site never runs two competing "
"page-cache authorities."
msgstr ""
"Il-cache tal-paġni portabbli taħt is-sjieda ta' YPerf diġà tikkontrolla "
"l-eżekuzzjoni tal-cache tal-paġni. L-adozzjoni nattiva Nginx tibqa' msakkra "
"biex is-sit qatt ma jħaddem żewġ awtoritajiet tal-cache tal-paġni li "
"jikkompetu."

msgid "The YPerf-owned replacement must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Is-sostituzzjoni taħt is-sjieda ta' YPerf trid tgħaddi l-verifika qabel il-"
"migrazzjoni tkun tista' tiġi ffinalizzata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The Yablonsky AI API key could not be saved. Check the key and server "
"cryptography support."
msgstr ""
"Iċ-ċavetta API ta' Yablonsky AI ma setgħetx tiġi ssejvjata. Iċċekkja "
"ċ-ċavetta u l-appoġġ għall-kriptografija tas-server."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The account API key authenticates optional Yablonsky AI remote compute. It "
"is not a plugin license and never unlocks local YPerf functionality. "
"External requests happen only after an explicit administrator action."
msgstr ""
"Iċ-ċavetta API tal-kont tawtentika l-komputazzjoni remota fakultattiva ta' "
"Yablonsky AI. Mhijiex liċenzja tal-plugin u qatt ma tiftaħ funzjonalità "
"lokali ta' YPerf. Talbiet esterni jsiru biss wara azzjoni espliċita tal-"
"amministratur."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The adopted cache zone is used by more than one Nginx server block. YPerf "
"will not prepare a zone-wide purge path that could affect another site."
msgstr ""
"Iż-żona tal-cache adottata tintuża minn aktar minn blokk wieħed tas-server "
"Nginx. YPerf mhux se jħejji triq tat-tindif taż-żona kollha li tista' "
"taffettwa sit ieħor."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The audit is ready and will keep the 50 most recent semantic invalidation "
"requests."
msgstr "L-awditu huwa lest u se jżomm l-aħħar 50 talba għal invalidazzjoni semantika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The baseline was rolled back after proof detected a failure or confirmed "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"Il-linja bażi treġġgħet lura wara li l-prova sabet falliment jew rigressjoni"
" kkonfermata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The bundled Host Inspector file is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "Il-fajl Host Inspector inkluż fil-pakkett huwa nieqes jew ma jistax jinqara."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid "The cache zone is visible, but its server-block ownership is not proven yet."
msgstr ""
"Iż-żona tal-cache hija viżibbli, iżda s-sjieda tagħha tal-blokk tas-server "
"għadha mhix ivverifikata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The campaign changes only the YPerf-owned portable Page Cache boundary."
msgstr ""
"Il-kampanja tbiddel biss il-limitu tal-cache tal-paġni portabbli taħt is-"
"sjieda ta' YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The contract preserves an explicit admin worker reserve and records the "
"exact before-state. R3 can adopt an already-safe native max_children limit "
"without rewriting PHP-FPM; any future host rewrite still requires syntax "
"test, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and rollback."
msgstr ""
"Il-kuntratt iżomm riżerva espliċita ta' proċessi tal-amministrazzjoni u "
"jirreġistra l-istat eżatt ta' qabel. R3 jista' jadotta limitu nattiv "
"max_children li diġà huwa sigur mingħajr ma jerġa' jikteb PHP-FPM; kull "
"kitba futura fuq il-host xorta teħtieġ test tas-sintassi, qari mill-ġdid, "
"aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni u treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current Redis eviction policy is not an allkeys LRU/LFU policy. Adoption"
" remains blocked pending explicit review."
msgstr ""
"Il-politika attwali tat-tneħħija tad-dejta Redis mhijiex politika allkeys "
"LRU/LFU. L-adozzjoni tibqa' mblukkata sakemm issir reviżjoni espliċita."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The current YPerf Runtime Acceptance is missing, stale or contains a "
"functional failure. Control-plane capacity is not considered releasable "
"until the site baseline is clean."
msgstr ""
"L-aċċettazzjoni attwali waqt l-eżekuzzjoni ta' YPerf hija nieqsa, skaduta "
"jew fiha falliment funzjonali. Il-kapaċità tal-pjan ta' kontroll ma titqiesx"
" disponibbli għar-rilaxx sakemm il-linja bażi tas-sit ma tkunx nadifa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf early runtime must pass before Video Lite can be changed."
msgstr ""
"L-ambjent bikri attwali ta' YPerf irid jgħaddi l-verifika qabel ma Video "
"Lite jista' jinbidel."

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"L-ambjent bikri attwali ta' YPerf irid jgħaddi l-verifika qabel ma "
"l-ottimizzazzjoni tal-midja tkun tista' tinbidel."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf version has clean read-only proof."
msgstr "Il-verżjoni attwali ta' YPerf għandha prova nadifa għall-qari biss."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The current advanced-cache.php ownership or hash is ambiguous. Artifact "
"refresh is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Is-sjieda jew il-hash attwali ta' advanced-cache.php mhijiex ċara. "
"L-aġġornament tal-komponent huwa mblukkat għal reviżjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current origin probe proves BYPASS rather than HIT, so there is nothing "
"safe to adopt as an active page-cache executor yet."
msgstr ""
"Il-prova attwali tas-server tas-sors turi BYPASS minflok HIT, għalhekk għad "
"m'hemm xejn sigur x'jiġi adottat bħala eżekutur attiv tal-cache tal-paġni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The deeper check only adds localhost service reachability and optional "
"capability confirmation; it is not an installation step."
msgstr ""
"Il-verifika aktar profonda żżid biss l-aċċessibbiltà tas-servizzi localhost "
"u konferma fakultattiva tal-kapaċitajiet; mhijiex pass tal-installazzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The delivery engine is route-aware, skips cart/checkout/account and logged-"
"in traffic, preserves theme/jQuery execution, and is covered by Runtime "
"Acceptance plus automatic rollback."
msgstr ""
"Il-magna tat-twassil tagħraf ir-rotot, taqbeż karrettun/checkout/kont u "
"t-traffiku ta' utenti konnessi, tippreserva l-eżekuzzjoni tat-tema/jQuery u "
"hija koperta mill-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni flimkien mat-treġġigħ "
"lura awtomatiku."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The exact W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php is captured locally for rollback"
" before any file change."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl eżatt advanced-cache.php ta' W3 Total Cache jinġabar lokalment għat-"
"treġġigħ lura qabel kwalunkwe bidla fil-fajl."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing W3 Total Cache drop-in could not be backed up for rollback."
msgstr ""
"Ma setgħetx issir kopja ta' backup tad-drop-in eżistenti ta' W3 Total Cache "
"għat-treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing WP_CACHE=false declaration could not be changed safely."
msgstr "Id-dikjarazzjoni eżistenti WP_CACHE=false ma setgħetx tinbidel b'mod sigur."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing YPerf Page Cache artifact could not be read for rollback."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent eżistenti tal-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf ma setax jinqara għat-"
"treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The existing YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility "
"chain. Refresh is blocked."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent eżistenti tal-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf mhuwiex fil-katina tal-"
"kompatibbiltà riveduta. L-aġġornament huwa mblukkat."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The existing site pool already has a bounded worker limit and current "
"acceptance is clean. YPerf can adopt that native limit without changing PHP-"
"FPM."
msgstr ""
"Il-grupp eżistenti tas-sit diġà għandu limitu tal-proċessi u l-aċċettazzjoni"
" attwali hija nadifa. YPerf jista' jadotta dak il-limitu nattiv mingħajr ma "
"jbiddel PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The frozen Redis database or key namespace is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Id-database Redis jew l-ispazju tal-ismijiet taċ-ċwievet iffriżat mhuwiex "
"validu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The handover button unlocks automatically after Step 4 proves that all "
"active provider responsibilities have a safe path."
msgstr ""
"Il-buttuna tat-trasferiment tinfetaħ awtomatikament wara li l-Pass 4 "
"jivverifika li r-responsabbiltajiet attivi kollha tal-fornitur għandhom triq"
" sigura."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The helper is bundled with this exact YPerf release. It does not install "
"packages, edit configuration, restart services, scan Redis keys or export "
"raw server configuration."
msgstr ""
"Il-helper huwa inkluż ma' dan ir-rilaxx eżatt ta' YPerf. Ma jinstallax "
"pakketti, ma jbiddilx konfigurazzjoni, ma jerġax jibda servizzi, ma "
"jiskennjax ċwievet Redis u ma jesportax konfigurazzjoni mhux ipproċessata "
"tas-server."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The imported configuration failed the final Health Check."
msgstr "Il-konfigurazzjoni importata falliet fil-verifika finali tas-saħħa."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The installed YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility"
" chain."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent installat tal-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf mhuwiex fil-katina tal-"
"kompatibbiltà riveduta."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php is unexpectedly large, so YPerf refused "
"automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl preċedenti advanced-cache.php huwa kbir b'mod mhux mistenni, "
"għalhekk YPerf irrifjuta t-tindif awtomatiku."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php no longer has high-confidence W3 Total Cache "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl preċedenti advanced-cache.php m'għadux taħt is-sjieda ta' W3 Total "
"Cache bi probabbiltà għolja."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The legacy drop-in could not be captured safely, so nothing was removed."
msgstr "Id-drop-in preċedenti ma setax jinġabar b'mod sigur, għalhekk ma tneħħa xejn."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy provider is inactive, its owned advanced-cache.php is retired, "
"and post-cleanup Runtime Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"Il-fornitur preċedenti huwa inattiv, advanced-cache.php tiegħu ġie rtirat u "
"l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni wara t-tindif hija nadifa."

msgid ""
"The live YPerf Page Cache hash differs from the stored authority record. "
"Repair is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Il-hash dirett tal-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf huwa differenti mir-rekord tal-"
"awtorità maħżun. It-tiswija hija mblukkata għal reviżjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The loaded YPerf drop-in did not prove its own Redis connection, database "
"and namespace."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in mgħobbi ta' YPerf ma vverifikax il-konnessjoni Redis tiegħu "
"stess, id-database u l-ispazju tal-ismijiet."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The loaded object-cache drop-in does not match the approved artifact hash."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti mgħobbi ma jaqbilx mal-hash tal-komponent "
"approvat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf profile is proven, but no page-cache executor is active yet."
" Run the bounded Page Cache stability campaign to prove MISS → HIT, Runtime "
"safety and repeat-HIT consistency before moving deeper into Redis or Origin "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"Il-profil lokali ta' YPerf huwa vverifikat, iżda għadu m'hemm l-ebda "
"eżekutur tal-cache tal-paġni attiv. Ħaddem il-kampanja limitata tal-"
"istabbiltà tal-cache tal-paġni biex tivverifika MISS → HIT, is-sigurtà tal-"
"eżekuzzjoni u l-konsistenza ta' HIT ripetut qabel tidħol aktar fil-fond "
"f'Redis jew fl-irfinar tas-server tas-sors."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr ""
"Il-kontroll lokali tas-sigurtà ta' YPerf naqqas il-livell tal-profil AI għax"
" l-evidenza deterministika attwali ma tawtorizzax il-livell mitlub."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Il-profil lokali ġie applikat u aċċettat mill-aċċettazzjoni waqt "
"l-eżekuzzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress Plugin"
" Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never fabricated "
"from inside YPerf."
msgstr ""
"Il-kontrolli lokali tal-eżekuzzjoni u tal-pjan ta' kontroll huma "
"f'kundizzjoni tajba. Il-Plugin Check uffiċjali ta' WordPress jibqa' kontroll"
" estern ta' aċċettazzjoni mill-bniedem u qatt ma jinħoloq artifiċjalment "
"minn YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
" unexpected cache churn."
msgstr ""
"Il-log huwa lokali, limitat u maħsub għad-debugging ta' mewġ ta' "
"invalidazzjonijiet u bidliet mhux mistennija fil-cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
"a frozen provider list."
msgstr ""
"Il-katalgu tal-mudelli ġej mill-pjan tal-kont ivverifikat; YPerf ma "
"jinkludix lista fissa ta' fornituri."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model requested a broader profile than current deterministic evidence "
"allows. YPerf lowered it before any Apply became possible."
msgstr ""
"Il-mudell talab profil usa' milli tippermetti l-evidenza deterministika "
"attwali. YPerf naqqsu qabel ma setgħet issir kwalunkwe applikazzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The native executor is adopted, but current-version Runtime Acceptance must "
"be clean before an operation plan can advance."
msgstr ""
"L-eżekutur nattiv huwa adottat, iżda l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni tal-"
"verżjoni attwali trid tkun nadifa qabel ma pjan ta' operazzjoni jista' "
"javvanza."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The native proof belongs to a different hostname, so YPerf will not adopt it"
" for this site."
msgstr ""
"Il-prova nattiva tappartjeni għal hostname ieħor, għalhekk YPerf mhux se "
"jadottaha għal dan is-sit."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"L-ambjent il-ġdid taħt is-sjieda ta' YPerf irid jgħaddi l-verifika qabel ma "
"l-migrazzjoni tista' tiġi ffinalizzata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"L-aċċettazzjoni li jmiss waqt l-eżekuzzjoni se tiġbor l-għadd tal-"
"mistoqsijiet, il-ħin tad-database, l-għadd ta' mistoqsijiet bil-mod u "
"l-familji tagħhom għall-provi tal-frontend li jeżegwixxu fuq is-server tas-"
"sors."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr ""
"It-template tad-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti ma setax jiġi ġġenerat b'mod "
"sigur."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Il-fornitur il-qadim jiġi diżattivat biss fi ħdan tranżazzjoni. YPerf "
"imbagħad jirrikonċilja s-sjieda, jivverifika l-eżekuzzjoni, iwettaq "
"l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni u jirrestawra awtomatikament il-fornitur "
"preċedenti jekk il-prova tfalli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Il-prova attwali tas-server tas-sors turi BYPASS, għalhekk YPerf mhux se "
"jiddikjara aċċellerazzjoni tal-paġni."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "L-operazzjoni oriġinali tista' tkun għadha għaddejja. Tibdiehiex mill-ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Is-saff MU portabbli jipprovdi protezzjoni lokali tas-server tas-sors fuq "
"hosting standard ta' WordPress. Adapters nattivi tas-server u tal-edge "
"jistgħu jestendu l-protezzjoni aktar kmieni fit-triq tat-talba."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr ""
"Is-sett ta' talbiet wara l-applikazzjoni qed jivverifika r-rotot pubbliċi u "
"l-politiki tas-sigurtà."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Is-settings tar-responsabbiltajiet ta' W3 Total Cache ta' qabel il-"
"migrazzjoni ma setgħux jiġu rrestawrati awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"Il-profil preċedenti ta' YPerf ġie rrestawrat u l-aċċettazzjoni tat-treġġigħ"
" lura waqt l-eżekuzzjoni tlestiet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The previous YPerf settings are being restored and re-proved."
msgstr "Qed jiġu rrestawrati s-settings preċedenti ta' YPerf u vverifikati mill-ġdid."

msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Health "
"Check, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Il-fornitur diġà huwa inattiv. YPerf jieħu snapshot tal-advanced-cache.php "
"li fadal u li bi probabbiltà għolja jappartjeni lil W3TC, jirtira biss dak "
"il-komponent, iwettaq verifika tas-saħħa u jirrestawra awtomatikament il-"
"fajl eżatt jekk il-prova tfalli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Runtime "
"Acceptance, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Il-fornitur diġà huwa inattiv. YPerf jieħu snapshot tal-advanced-cache.php "
"li fadal u li bi probabbiltà għolja jappartjeni lil W3TC, jirtira biss dak "
"il-komponent, iwettaq aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni u jirrestawra "
"awtomatikament il-fajl eżatt jekk il-prova tfalli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The provider responsibility could not be retired safely."
msgstr "Ir-responsabbiltà tal-fornitur ma setgħetx tiġi rtirata b'mod sigur."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The provider responsibility could not be retired safely. No further "
"migration action was attempted."
msgstr ""
"Ir-responsabbiltà tal-fornitur ma setgħetx tiġi rtirata b'mod sigur. Ma sar "
"l-ebda tentattiv ta' migrazzjoni ulterjuri."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The provider-owned drop-in was not removed because read-back verification "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in taħt is-sjieda tal-fornitur ma tneħħiex għax il-verifika bil-qari"
" mill-ġdid falliet."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed MISS → HIT proof and the previous "
"artifact was restored."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent aġġornat tal-cache tal-paġni falla fil-prova MISS → HIT u "
"l-komponent preċedenti ġie rrestawrat."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed its read-back hash check and was "
"rolled back."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent aġġornat tal-cache tal-paġni falla fil-verifika tal-hash bil-"
"qari mill-ġdid u treġġa' lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed proof and automatic rollback could "
"not be confirmed. Stop and review before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Il-komponent aġġornat tal-cache tal-paġni falla fil-prova u ma setax jiġi "
"kkonfermat it-treġġigħ lura awtomatiku. Waqqaf u irrevedi qabel tkompli."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The report can correlate frontend timing with WordPress, cache ownership, "
"PHP/runtime capabilities and application integrations instead of seeing only"
" the public page."
msgstr ""
"Ir-rapport jista' jorbot il-ħin tal-frontend ma' WordPress, is-sjieda tal-"
"cache, il-kapaċitajiet PHP/tal-eżekuzzjoni u l-integrazzjonijiet tal-"
"applikazzjoni minflok jara biss il-paġna pubblika."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database could not be re-verified immediately before "
"activation."
msgstr ""
"Id-database Redis riżervata ma setgħetx terġa' tiġi vverifikata "
"immedjatament qabel l-attivazzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database is no longer empty. YPerf stopped before writing"
" object-cache.php; release the reservation and refresh Host Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Id-database Redis riżervata m'għadhiex vojta. YPerf waqaf qabel il-kitba ta'"
" object-cache.php; irrilaxxa r-riżerva u aġġorna Host Intelligence."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The reserved Redis target failed its bounded write/read/delete proof."
msgstr ""
"Il-mira Redis riżervata falliet fil-prova limitata tagħha ta' "
"kitba/qari/tħassir."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"The reserved logical database is no longer the empty database proven by "
"current host evidence. Release the reservation and re-evaluate instead of "
"reusing stale isolation evidence."
msgstr ""
"Id-database loġika riżervata m'għadhiex id-database vojta vverifikata mill-"
"evidenza attwali tal-host. Irrilaxxa r-riżerva u evalwa mill-ġdid minflok "
"terġa' tuża evidenza ta' iżolament skaduta."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The restored advanced-cache.php did not match the saved rollback fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php irrestawrat ma qabilx mal-marka diġitali tas-"
"snapshot salvat għat-treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI User API contract is not available."
msgstr "Il-kuntratt rivedut tal-API tal-utent ta' Yablonsky AI mhuwiex disponibbli."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI authentication contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Il-kuntratt rivedut tal-awtentikazzjoni Yablonsky AI mhuwiex komplut."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI compute contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Il-kuntratt rivedut tal-komputazzjoni Yablonsky AI mhuwiex komplut."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI contract needs attention."
msgstr "Il-kuntratt rivedut Yablonsky AI jeħtieġ attenzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be restored."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl advanced-cache.php salvat ta' W3 Total Cache ma setax jiġi "
"rrestawrat."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The saved Yablonsky AI credential could not be read. Save the key again."
msgstr ""
"Il-kredenzjal Yablonsky AI salvat ma setax jinqara. Issejvja ċ-ċavetta mill-"
"ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved legacy drop-in backup failed integrity verification."
msgstr "Il-backup salvat tad-drop-in preċedenti falla fil-verifika tal-integrità."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected AI model is not available to this verified workspace. Refresh "
"the account catalog and choose again."
msgstr ""
"Il-mudell AI magħżul mhuwiex disponibbli għal dan l-ispazju tax-xogħol "
"ivverifikat. Aġġorna l-katalgu tal-kont u erġa' agħżel."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected YPerf baseline was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Il-linja bażi magħżula ta' YPerf ġiet applikata u aċċettata mill-"
"aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"Il-linja bażi magħżula ta' YPerf ġiet applikata, aċċettata mill-"
"aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni u msaħħna minn qabel awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Il-mudell tat-test magħżul ta' Yablonsky AI mhuwiex disponibbli għal dan "
"l-ispazju tax-xogħol ivverifikat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Il-profil lokali magħżul issa jista' jiġi applikat fi ħdan il-limiti ta' "
"WordPress taħt is-sjieda ta' YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Il-backup tas-settings magħżul mhuwiex JSON validu."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Is-setting jibdel biss it-twassil mis-server tas-sors ta' WordPress. Entrati"
" eżistenti tal-cache HTML esterna ta' Nginx/Cloudflare jeħtieġu verifika "
"indipendenti tar-riċenza; YPerf ma jnaddafx fis-skiet il-caches tal-host."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Il-backup tas-settings ma fih l-ebda setting portabbli ta' YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr "Il-backup tas-settings jaqbeż il-limitu tas-sigurtà appoġġjat ta' 256 KB."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Is-sit huwa funzjonali, iżda l-kapaċità attwali disponibbli tal-host/FPM ma "
"tivverifikax riżerva komda għall-amministrazzjoni waqt pressjoni fuq il-"
"frontend. Ir-reviżjoni ta' Origin Budget għandha tippreserva riżerva "
"espliċita għall-pjan ta' kontroll."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Is-sit huwa mmappjat ma' grupp PHP-FPM konkret; ir-rakkomandazzjonijiet tal-"
"baġit tas-server tas-sors issa jistgħu jkunu bbażati fuq evidenza."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Il-grupp tas-sit huwa mmappjat, iżda m'hemm l-ebda kampjun dirett RSS tal-"
"memorja tal-proċessi. Tiddeduċix Origin Budget mill-konfigurazzjoni biss."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr ""
"Id-dijanjostika tas-sitemap baqgħet fi ħdan il-baġit limitat tal-eżekuzzjoni"
" tagħha."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Il-metrika tal-istabbiltà hija evidenza lokali tal-cache tal-istess oriġini,"
" mhux punteġġ ta' Google PageSpeed. Uża testijiet PageSpeed ripetuti aktar "
"tard bħala verifika esterna fuq il-post wara li YPerf ikun ivverifika "
"eżekuzzjoni deterministika tal-cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti ppreparat falla fil-verifika tal-hash bil-"
"qari mill-ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Il-hash maħżun tal-komponent tal-cache tal-paġni ma jaqbilx mal-fajl dirett."
" L-aġġornament huwa mblukkat."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Iż-żona hija esklużiva għal dan il-blokk tas-server. YPerf jista' jwettaq "
"it-tisħin preliminari issa filwaqt li l-kitba fuq il-host tibqa' msakkra."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Il-kuntrast tat-tema, l-istili tal-aċċessibbiltà u skripts ta' partijiet "
"terzi bħall-widgets taċ-chat jibqgħu barra minn dan il-limitu tal-kitba. "
"YPerf jista' jiddijanjostika dawk l-ispejjeż aktar tard, iżda din il-"
"kampanja ma terġax tikteb kodiċi estern biss biex ittejjeb punteġġ ta' "
"referenza."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Aħseb fih bħal PageSpeed Insights b'aċċess għal dak li jiġri minn ġewwa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr ""
"Din il-kapaċità ta' YPerf titħaddem mill-fluss tax-xogħol limitat iddedikat "
"tagħha."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Din il-migrazzjoni kompluta tibqa' viżibbli fl-istorja. Aġġornamenti futuri "
"ta' YPerf mhux se jitolbuk temigra l-istess fornitur mill-ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "Dan il-fajl mhuwiex backup appoġġjat tas-settings ta' Yablonsky Performance."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Dan il-kontroll ibiddel inċidenti intermittenti tal-amministrazzjoni "
"f'evidenza espliċita għar-rilaxx jew l-irfinar. Qatt ma jgħolli l-memorja "
"PHP, ma jbiddilx FPM u ma jimmodifikax l-aġġornatur ta' WordPress "
"awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Dan l-indikatur isegwi l-konfigurazzjoni tas-sit u l-evidenza — mhux il-"
"progress tal-iżvilupp ta' YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Din hija kapaċità tal-ambjent ta' eżekuzzjoni PHP, mhux xi ħaġa li YPerf "
"għandu jimita f'WordPress."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"Dan huwa vantaġġ ewlieni ta' YPerf: ix-xogħol tal-ewwel talba jiġi ttrattat "
"separatament mill-cache tat-talbiet ripetuti."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"Dan huwa saff lokali ta' ottimizzazzjoni b'riskju baxx; huwa separat apposta"
" mill-adozzjoni tal-cache u tas-server."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Dan huwa separat mit-Tħejjija tas-Sit. Isegwi jekk il-fornitur preċedenti "
"misjub jistax jiġi rtirat mingħajr ma tintilef responsabbiltà attiva."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"Din hija t-tweġiba għal “x'qed jaħdem tassew?”. Is-sejbien waħdu qatt ma "
"jingħata status ATTIV aħdar."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"Dan huwa l-ewwel limitu espliċitu tal-kitba lokali: YPerf jista' joħloq biss"
" il-fajl tiegħu wp-content/object-cache.php u ċwievet Redis tas-saħħa/cache "
"bi spazju tal-ismijiet apposta fid-database loġika riżervata."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Din ir-responsabbiltà tal-fornitur mhijiex appoġġjata mis-soluzzjoni gwidata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"Dan l-aġġornament huwa għall-qari biss: jerġa' jiċċekkja l-ambjent, iwettaq "
"l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni u jibni mill-ġdid it-test ta' referenza "
"tal-prestazzjoni. Ma jattivax il-cache, ma jbiddilx fornituri u ma jibdilx "
"il-konfigurazzjoni tal-host."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Dan is-sit għandu biżżejjed kontenut ippubblikat biex l-awtomazzjoni tal-"
"fluss tal-pubblikazzjoni ssir rilevanti. Integrazzjoni futura ma' Yablonsky "
"Publisher tista' tuża evidenza tal-prestazzjoni ta' YPerf mingħajr ma "
"tbiddel id-dashboard tal-cache f'żona tar-reklamar."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Din il-ħarsa fil-livell tas-sit issegwi rotot fakultattivi ta' Redis jew "
"eżekuzzjoni nattiva tal-host u evidenza tal-irtirar tal-fornitur. Hija "
"informattiva u ma tagħmilx il-karatteristiċi fakultattivi tal-host rekwiżit "
"għar-rilaxx fis-suq."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Dan is-snapshot jivverifika biss parti mill-munzell nattiv. Ħaddem Host "
"Inspector inkluż mar-rilaxx attwali ta' YPerf biex tiġbor sjieda Nginx "
"speċifika għas-sit, iżolament u kapaċità Redis u evidenza eżatta tal-memorja"
" tal-proċessi PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Din il-kaxxa hija evidenza biss. YPerf ma jiddikjarax sjieda ta' saff estern"
" ta' eżekuzzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Tliet kampjuni tal-frontend għal kull rotta flimkien ma' testijiet iżolati "
"lokali ta' qari Redis/Memcached. Ma jinbidel l-ebda setting tal-cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Ħin"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Token permissions"
msgstr "Permessi tat-token"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Għodod"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"Tracks Runtime Acceptance, benchmark, purge and prewarm activity now; native"
" adapters can add HIT/MISS/BYPASS/STALE, object-cache hit ratio and eviction"
" counters."
msgstr ""
"Isegwi l-attività tal-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni, it-testijiet ta' "
"referenza, it-tindif u t-tisħin preliminari issa; adapters nattivi jistgħu "
"jżidu HIT/MISS/BYPASS/STALE, ir-rata ta' HIT tal-cache tal-oġġetti u l-għadd"
" tat-tneħħijiet tad-dejta."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Transactional handover is allowed to start."
msgstr "It-trasferiment tranżazzjonali jista' jibda."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Transactional handover is blocked."
msgstr "It-trasferiment tranżazzjonali huwa mblukkat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Transactional handover is ready."
msgstr "It-trasferiment tranżazzjonali huwa lest."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Translation integrity rule:"
msgstr "Regola tal-integrità tat-traduzzjoni:"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Itfi"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Ixgħel"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Turns on and verifies YPerf Page Cache, Browser Cache and safe WordPress "
"frontend optimization. Server configuration and WooCommerce first-hit "
"protection stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Jattiva u jivverifika l-cache tal-paġni ta' YPerf, il-cache tal-browser u "
"l-ottimizzazzjoni sigura tal-frontend ta' WordPress. Il-konfigurazzjoni tas-"
"server u l-protezzjoni tal-ewwel talba WooCommerce jibqgħu kif inhuma."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Two-pass confirmation"
msgstr "Konferma f'żewġ passi"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tip"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "UNKNOWN"
msgstr "MHUX MAGĦRUF"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "URL to inspect"
msgstr "URL biex tispezzjona"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "URL to purge"
msgstr "URL biex tnaddaf il-cache tiegħu"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Unavailable / stale"
msgstr "Mhux disponibbli / skadut"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php includes/class-yperf-capability-detector.php
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Mhux magħruf"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid "Unknown Page Cache campaign step."
