msgid "YPerf dashboard sections"
msgstr "Sezzjonijiet tad-dashboard ta' YPerf"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf deliberately cannot mark its own Plugin Check green. The official "
"checker stays an independent human acceptance signal."
msgstr ""
"YPerf apposta ma jistax jimmarka l-Plugin Check tiegħu bħala aħdar. Il-"
"kontroll uffiċjali jibqa' sinjal indipendenti ta' aċċettazzjoni mill-"
"bniedem."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not build a second cache. The adoption stage recognizes a fresh, "
"proven site-specific Nginx cache as the authoritative page-cache executor "
"without editing Nginx or restarting any service."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ma jibnix it-tieni cache. L-istadju tal-adozzjoni jirrikonoxxi cache "
"Nginx riċenti u vverifikata speċifika għas-sit bħala l-eżekutur awtorevoli "
"tal-cache tal-paġni mingħajr ma jimmodifika Nginx jew jerġa' jibda servizz."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not change pm.max_children, pm.max_requests or reload PHP-FPM in "
"this release."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ma jbiddilx pm.max_children jew pm.max_requests u ma jerġax jgħabbi "
"PHP-FPM f'dan ir-rilaxx."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf does not yet recognize this web-server family."
msgstr "YPerf għadu ma jirrikonoxxix din il-familja ta' servers tal-web."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf enables this only when Redis isolation and memory headroom are safe. "
"It is never forced just to increase a feature count."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jattiva dan biss meta l-iżolament Redis u l-kapaċità tal-memorja "
"disponibbli jkunu siguri. Qatt ma jiġi sfurzat biss biex jiżdied l-għadd "
"tal-karatteristiċi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf first captures a fresh read-only baseline, then applies the selected "
"local profile and immediately repeats Runtime Acceptance. A preflight FAIL "
"makes no changes; a post-apply FAIL restores the previous profile "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf l-ewwel jiġbor linja bażi ġdida għall-qari biss, imbagħad japplika "
"l-profil lokali magħżul u minnufih jirrepeti l-aċċettazzjoni waqt "
"l-eżekuzzjoni. Falliment preliminari ma jagħmel l-ebda bidla; falliment wara"
" l-applikazzjoni jirrestawra awtomatikament il-profil preċedenti."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has a current local reservation for the isolated Redis target. No "
"Redis key, drop-in or server configuration has been created."
msgstr ""
"YPerf għandu riżerva lokali attwali għall-mira Redis iżolata. Ma nħolqot "
"l-ebda ċavetta Redis, drop-in jew konfigurazzjoni tas-server."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"YPerf adotta l-limitu eżistenti PHP-FPM max_children bħala l-baġit tas-"
"server tas-sors tas-sit. L-ebda fajl tal-host ma reġa' nkiteb għax il-limitu"
" nattiv attwali diġà jinforza l-limitu rivedut."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf għandu identità eżatta tal-grupp tas-sit, evidenza diretta tal-memorja"
" tal-proċessi u aċċettazzjoni attwali waqt l-eżekuzzjoni. Dan huwa biżżejjed"
" biex jiġi rivedut baġit limitat tas-server tas-sors, iżda mhux biżżejjed "
"biex jinbidel FPM awtomatikament."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"YPerf għandu identità eżatta tal-grupp, evidenza diretta tal-memorja tal-"
"proċessi u mudell tar-riżerva tal-pjan ta' kontroll. R2 jiffriża l-istat ta'"
" qabel rivedut u l-awtorità tat-treġġigħ lura mingħajr ma jimmodifika PHP-"
"FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "YPerf diġà huwa attiv"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"YPerf qed japplika biss settings tal-prestazzjoni mil-lista tal-permessi, "
"imbagħad jivverifikahom bil-qari mill-ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr ""
"YPerf qed jippreserva r-responsabbiltà tal-cache tal-browser meta kienet "
"attiva fis-sors."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "YPerf qed jippreserva r-responsabbiltà tal-cache tal-browser ippreparata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"YPerf qed inaddaf l-URL tal-paġna ewlenija permezz tal-awtorità tal-cache "
"tiegħu u l-pont adottat tat-tindif Cloudflare."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf qed jirrestawra biss settings li biddel qabel u mhux se jikteb fuq "
"bidliet esterni mhux relatati."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf qed isaħħan minn qabel sett limitat ta' URLs pubbliċi ta' valur għoli "
"biex l-ewwel viżitatur ma jħallasx l-ispiża ta' cache kiesaħ."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
