"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jista' jeżegwixxi biss l-operazzjonijiet lokali ddedikati li "
"l-kuntratti eżatti tagħhom jidhru hawn fuq. Kitba fuq il-konfigurazzjoni "
"tal-host għadha teħtieġ helper separatament rivedut b'backup, differenza "
"eżatta, test tas-sintassi, qari mill-ġdid, aċċettazzjoni u treġġigħ lura."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jeħtieġ evidenza Redis attwali għall-qari biss. Jista' juża snapshot "
"attwali ta' Host Inspector jew jispezzjona direttament servizz PhpRedis "
"lokali mingħajr ma jikteb ċwievet jew ibiddel il-konfigurazzjoni Redis."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "YPerf qatt ma jbiddel"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Id-drop-in tal-cache tal-oġġetti ta' YPerf tneħħa. Redis ma ġiex imnaddaf "
"jew ikkonfigurat mill-ġdid."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"YPerf huwa responsabbli biss għal Rocket Loader MITFI, HTTP/3 MIXGĦUL u "
"s-sinkronizzazzjoni tat-tindif tal-cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf huwa sid tas-saffi migrati u l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni wara "
"t-trasferiment hija nadifa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf huwa sid tar-responsabbiltajiet migrati u l-aċċettazzjoni waqt "
"l-eżekuzzjoni wara t-trasferiment hija nadifa."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"YPerf huwa sid tal-eżekutur portabbli tal-cache tal-paġni WordPress, tal-"
"politika tal-possibbiltà tal-caching, tat-tindif selettiv, tat-tisħin "
"preliminari, tal-prova tal-eżekuzzjoni u tat-treġġigħ lura. Il-cache nattiva"
" tas-server tibqa' triq separata ta' adozzjoni."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"YPerf huwa sid tas-saffi sostituti ppreparati. L-istatus ta' attivazzjoni "
"ta' plugin ieħor qatt ma nbidel minn YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"Il-cache persistenti tal-oġġetti ta' YPerf hija attiva. Il-prova ta' kitba u"
" qari Redis u l-aċċettazzjoni waqt l-eżekuzzjoni għaddew."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "Politika YPerf"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ħejja t-trasferiment iżda mhux se jiddiżattiva W3 Total Cache. Iftaħ "
"Plugins, iddiżattiva W3 Total Cache int stess, erġa' lura hawn u mbagħad "
"kompli. Dan iżomm l-istatus ta' attivazzjoni tal-plugins taħt il-kontroll "
"tiegħek."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"YPerf iħejji trasferiment riversibbli, imbagħad jitolbok tiddiżattiva W3 "
"Total Cache int stess fl-iskrin Plugins ta' WordPress. Meta tirritorna, "
"YPerf jirrikonċilja s-sjieda, jivverifika l-eżekuzzjoni u jwettaq verifika "
"tas-saħħa. YPerf qatt ma jbiddel l-istatus ta' attivazzjoni ta' plugin "
"ieħor."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jippreserva l-intenzjoni li s-sors ikun MITFI u jattiva l-cache tal-"
"paġni biss meta dik ir-responsabbiltà fil-fatt teħtieġ sostituzzjoni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jaqra l-konfigurazzjoni tal-fornitur permezz tal-API pubblika tal-"
"eżekuzzjoni tiegħu. Ma jbiddilx is-settings W3TC."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr "YPerf jaqra s-settings taż-żona u l-istat effettiv tat-twassil."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jirrikonoxxi l-cache Nginx FastCGI ivverifikata bħala l-eżekutur "
"awtorevoli tal-cache tal-paġni. Ma nbidlet l-ebda konfigurazzjoni tas-"
"server."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrifjuta li jneħħi advanced-cache.php għax is-sjieda tiegħu minn W3 "
"Total Cache inbidlet qabel il-ħin tal-kitba."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"Is-sostituzzjoni ta' YPerf hija lesta; id-deċiżjoni dwar l-istatus finali "
"ta' attivazzjoni tal-plugin tibqa' tal-utent."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "Politika tat-tweġibiet YPerf attiva"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-bidliet tiegħu stess u ħalla l-istatus ta' attivazzjoni "
"tal-plugins kif kien."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-bidliet tal-migrazzjoni tiegħu stess. Jekk trid terġa' "
"tattiva W3 Total Cache, agħmel dan int stess mill-iskrin Plugins ta' "
"WordPress."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-bidliet tal-migrazzjoni tiegħu stess. W3 Total Cache "
"jibqa' inattiv sakemm l-amministratur jagħżel li jerġa' jattivah mill-"
"Plugins."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-bidliet parzjali tiegħu stess. L-istatus ta' attivazzjoni"
" tal-plugins jibqa' taħt il-kontroll tal-utent."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "YPerf irrestawra s-settings Cloudflare li kien adotta."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-istat preċedenti tas-sjieda u waqaf qabel ma aċċetta "
"t-trasferiment."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"YPerf irrestawra l-istat preċedenti, reġa' attiva s-swiċċijiet tar-"
"responsabbiltajiet irtirati ta' W3TC u reġa' attiva W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"YPerf reġġa' lura kull bidla magħmula minn din l-eżekuzzjoni tal-"
"migrazzjoni, inkluż is-swiċċijiet tar-responsabbiltajiet ta' W3TC ta' qabel "
"it-trasferiment."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf reġġa' lura t-trasferiment parzjali u rrestawra s-swiċċijiet tar-"
"responsabbiltajiet tal-fornitur ta' qabel it-trasferiment qabel reġa' ta "
"l-kontroll."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "It-treġġigħ lura ta' YPerf tlesta."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"It-treġġigħ lura ta' YPerf tlesta. W3 Total Cache ma ġiex attivat mill-ġdid "
"awtomatikament; WordPress.org jeħtieġ li dik id-deċiżjoni tibqa' f'idejk."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "Is-settings YPerf ġew importati u vverifikati b'suċċess."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf waqaf wara tentattiv ta' treġġigħ lura protett, iżda komponent wieħed "
"tat-treġġigħ lura ma setax jiġi vverifikat. L-interfaċċa mhux se tiddikjara "
"treġġigħ lura komplut."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"YPerf jittratta Redis/Valkey bħala memorja tax-xogħol limitata b'iżolament, "
"maxmemory, viżibbiltà tar-rati HIT/MISS u tat-tneħħija tad-dejta."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"YPerf juża spazju tal-ismijiet speċifiku għas-sit u invalidazzjoni tal-cache"
" bbażata fuq il-ġenerazzjonijiet sabiex it-treġġigħ lura qatt ma jeħtieġ it-"
"tħassir ta' dejta Redis mhux relatata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mhux se jattiva l-cache tal-paġni portabbli tiegħu waqt li eżekutur "
"nattiv adottat għandu l-awtorità tal-cache tal-paġni. L-ewwel irrevedi jew "
"irrilaxxa dik l-adozzjoni jekk intenzjonalment trid tbiddel l-eżekuturi."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mhux se jbiddel advanced-cache.php jekk is-sjieda tiegħu mhix "
"ivverifikata."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mhux se jattiva caching tal-mistoqsijiet tad-database biss biex iżid "
"l-għadd tal-karatteristiċi. Irid jivverifika benefiċċju li jista' jitkejjel "
"flimkien mal-cache tal-oġġetti u l-indiċijiet reali tad-database."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
"mode, workspace header and Writer transport all pass the local contract "
